{
    "name": "@madie/madie-cql-library",
    "version": "0.0.1",
    "description": "A single-spa web application that provides the MADiE standalone CQL Library experience for authoring and managing CQL libraries.",
    "longDescription": "madie-cql-library is a single-spa, React-based web application that delivers the standalone CQL Library capability within the Measure Authoring Development Integrated Environment (MADiE). It supports creating, editing, viewing, and managing Clinical Quality Language (CQL) libraries used in eCQM and digital measure development workflows. The application is built with TypeScript/JavaScript and leverages shared MADiE UI components (madie-design-system) and MADiE domain models (madie-models). It is intended to be composed into the broader MADiE micro-frontend architecture and distributed as a web build artifact for deployment within the MADiE platform.",
